{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    美股｜英偉達斥30億美元入股Meta 深化多層面AI領域合作           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">英偉達宣布出資30億美元認購Meta新股份，雙方進一步深化人工智能領域的戰略合作。Meta將擴大部署英偉達Vera Rubin運算平台及相關晶片，優化旗下Muse系列AI模型的運作效能。雙方亦會探討相關技術加強AI代理的安全管理，兩家企業的管理層均對合作前景給予正面評價。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T18:41:13.212703+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T18:00:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T18:38:24.862022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T18:38:24.862022+00:00","content_hash":"cd7899bbc601d567334dd59b658bbd918db9eca6bdb299f5cf9d63f99bcc1054","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}